Package: ferx
Title: Nonlinear Mixed Effects Modeling with Rust Backend
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ron Keizer", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ron@insightrx.com"),
    person("Teun Post", role = "aut", email = "teunpost@gmail.com"),
    person("Hidde van de Beek", role = "aut", email = "hiddevdbeek@icloud.com"))
Author: Ron Keizer [aut, cre], Teun Post [aut], Hidde van de Beek [aut]
Maintainer: Ron Keizer <ron@insightrx.com>
Description: Fast NLME estimation using FOCE/FOCEI with analytic gradients.
    Powered by a Rust engine with hand-rolled analytic sensitivities for exact
    gradients. Supports analytical PK models (1/2-compartment) and ODE-based
    models.
